      <title>小米18 Fold定义中折叠形态 搭载MiMo端侧大模型</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/ai001/post/20260902/%E5%B0%8F%E7%B1%B318-Fold%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E4%B8%AD%E6%8A%98%E5%8F%A0%E5%BD%A2%E6%80%81-%E6%90%AD%E8%BD%BDMiMo%E7%AB%AF%E4%BE%A7%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/</link>
